License
=======

Prism is a civic data platform: a shared, checkable picture of India from
official government statistics — and nothing else. That picture does not
belong to a party, a ministry, or a news cycle. See docs/vision.md.

This file licenses Prism’s original work only. It does not make Prism the
statistical office, and it does not re-license the official record.

Copyright (c) 2026 Suresh Jaladanki


Official statistics
-------------------

Surveys, censuses, administrative series, budget figures, and other public
official statistics remain the work of their producing offices. Prism does
not own them and does not grant a licence in them.

Each series keeps the terms recorded on its citation card (producer, series,
date, fetch source, and that office’s licence). If a producer’s terms forbid
a use, those terms win. Reproduce numbers accurately, with the producer cite.
Do not present Prism as the source of the official figure.


